    <body>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #080707;&quot;&gt;Date Updated:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #080707;&quot;&gt; Friday, April 24, 2020&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #080707;&quot;&gt;Account Owners!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #080707;&quot;&gt; . Please complete the annual team member audit &lt;a href=&quot;https://intel.lightning.force.com/lightning/n/Core_Account_Team_Review&quot; style=&quot;color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt; no later than &lt;b&gt;Thursday, May 7th&lt;/b&gt;.  Reminders will be sent on &lt;b&gt;May 4&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/b&gt; to Account Owners with incomplete audits.  Thanks to those for who have completed their audits already– we are at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&